kadam 0.4
// A test of kadam 0.4: a replica of a data-teams product page, with a stand-in brand.

The page is called "Northwind for data teams".
The page background is black.
The page text is white.
The page fades in when it opens.

Nav bar:
    It sticks to the top. The background is black.
    Give it 14px padding on the top and bottom and 32px padding on the left and right.
    The Northwind mark shows "assets/mark.svg" on the left. It is 28px wide.
    The word "Business" in bold. The text is 18px.
    After that, a 28px gap.
    A NavLink says "Why Northwind".
    A NavLink says "Products".
    A NavLink says "Solutions".
    A NavLink says "Resources".
    A NavLink says "Customers".
    A NavLink says "Pricing".
    A small #222222 pill button with white text says "Try Northwind" on the right.
    A small white pill button with black text says "Contact sales" on the right.

Hero section, centered:
    The background is a black to #1C130D gradient from top to bottom.
    Give it 88px padding on the top and 72px padding on the bottom and 24px padding on the left and right.

    A big heading says "Data intelligence for every team's most ambitious work". The text is 64px. The text weight is 500.
    The letter spacing is -1.9px. The text is at most 24 characters wide.
    After that, a 24px gap.
    White text, 17px, says "Northwind Work gives everyone the power to answer complex business questions, build interactive dashboards, and act on what they find, no specialized skills required." The text is at most 54 characters wide.
    After that, a 36px gap.
    Side by side with 20px gap:
        A white pill button with black text says "Contact sales". It has 10px padding on the top and bottom and 20px padding on the left and right. The text is 14px.
        A white link says "Install data agent ›". The text is not underlined. The text is 14px. It goes to page "Northwind for data teams".

    After that, a 110px gap.
    Customers, side by side with 120px gap:
        The word "lakehouse" in bold. The text is 28px.
        The word "LEDGER" in bold. The text is 34px.
        The word "VOLTA" in bold. The text is 30px.
        The word "Kumo" in bold. The text is 30px.
        The word "glacier" in bold. The text is 28px.

    After that, a 96px gap.
    A picture of the product demo shows "assets/video-poster.svg". It is 1140px wide. It has 12px rounded corners. It has a 1px #FFFFFF22 border.

Plugins section, centered:
    Give it 120px padding on the top and 24px padding on the left and right.
    A heading says "Work across your data with trusted business context". The text is 48px. The text weight is 500.
    The letter spacing is -1.4px. The text is at most 26 characters wide.
    After that, a 24px gap.
    White text, 17px, says "Plugins connect Northwind Work to your data ecosystem so you can analyze data, answer questions, and create interactive dashboards with no specialized skills required." The text is at most 70 characters wide.
    After that, a 48px gap.
    In 5 columns with 24px gap:
        It is at most 1120px wide. It is full width.
        For each plugin in plugins:
            A row:
                Give it 12px padding. It has a 1px #FFFFFF33 border. It has 16px rounded corners. It has 14px gap between children.
                It centers its children vertically.
                The logo shows "{the logo of the plugin}". It is decorative. It is 44px wide.
                Text says "{the name of the plugin}". The text is 15px.
    After that, a 48px gap.
    Side by side with 12px gap:
        A small white pill button with black text says "View all plugins".
        A small #222222 pill button with white text says "Data agent".

Features section:
    Give it 140px padding on the top and 32px padding on the left and right.
    A heading says "Now everyone can put data to work". The text is 48px. The text weight is 500. The letter spacing is -1.4px. The text is centered.
    After that, a 40px gap.
    In 4 columns with 24px gap:
        It stretches its children.
        A FeatureCard with the title "Connect your data ecosystem" and the description "Northwind Work brings together your data warehouses, data lakes, BI tools, spreadsheets, and business documents so every analysis starts with complete context.".
        A FeatureCard with the title "Analyze data by asking" and the description "Start by asking a business question in plain language. You can explore datasets, compare segments, and identify possible causes.".
        A FeatureCard with the title "Turn insights into agentic dashboards" and the description "Create interactive dashboards, reports, and presentations that help stakeholders understand what changed, why it matters, and what to do next.".
        A FeatureCard with the title "Take actions from proven analysis" and the description "Identify the right stakeholders and share insights through chat or email. Northwind Work recommends next steps and takes approved actions with connected tools.".

Prompts section:
    Give it 140px padding on the top and 32px padding on the left and right.
    A heading says "Try Northwind Work prompts for data teams". The text is 48px. The text weight is 500. The letter spacing is -1.4px.
